			"date": "2023-02-01T17:25:33.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/@khalidabuhakmeh\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>khalidabuhakmeh</span></a></span> I can second Khalid on this. We (JetBrains) have a big Gatsby site that I started Oct 2018.</p><p>He and I are busy on a rewrite using new 11ty 2.0 stuff, to make the port easier: Vite (to give TS), TSX, Vitest (to replace our Jest tests), and TypeBox (to kind of scratch some of the GraphQL itch.)</p>",
